title: Terry_IR
---
<<set_left CharacterManager Terry>>
<<wait .15>>
<<set_right CharacterManager Francine>>
<<wait .15>>
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Terry: Say it.
Terry is actively not looking at you, doing that thing where he wants you to try and make eye contact so that he can not make eye contact.
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Francine: Say… what?
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Terry: Oh come on. I’m sure you’ve noticed.
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Francine: Noticed what?
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Terry: I just… never thought it could happen to me, you know?
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Francine: That what could happen?
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Terry: This.
Terry gives you a thumbs up.
Terry: I know. It’s hard to look at.
His thumb is… kind of red? Maybe?
Terry: It could be bowler’s thumb. They put me on IR for the week, man. What am I gonna do?
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Francine: Well-
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Terry: What am I gonna tell my coach? The team? What if I let them down?
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Francine: Oh, Terry… maybe–
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Terry: And most importantly, what are the babes gonna think, Francy?
-> What babes?
    Terry: Real mature, Francy. Kicking a man while he’s down. 
    He kicks a nearby plastic trashcan. The cans inside jostle loudly.
    Terry: Whatever. I’m gonna go strum one out. 
    Terry: DON’T follow me.
-> Maybe they’ll be into it?
    Terry: …really?
    <<right CharacterManager>>
    <<wait .15>>
    Francine: They might get a kick out of nursing you back to health?
    <<left CharacterManager>>
    <<wait .15>>
    Terry: Oh my god. Medical babes. Francy, you’re a genius. 
    He raises his hand for a fistbumb, and it’s only a little awkward when Cine moves your arm too fast and the plastic knuckles make an audible WHAP sound against his.
<<ending CharacterManager>>
===
